Z||000005||JohnF||08-18-2001||08:59 AM||||Thanks theogre, but---<BR>After reading your notes, I get an idea that I definitely need an IAT (or MATS).  Where do I get one that is "plastic" sealed?  AutoZone cannot even special order one!||||reg||1
Z||000006||theogre||08-18-2001||01:39 PM||||Not plastic sealed...  You're looking for a plastic cage over the actual sensor element. Instead of one that has a metal caged enlement. <P>Anyplace that caries Borg Warner, like Pep Boys, will have the right one.<P>You're getting an engine light at startup but no codes? that is odd..... I'd find an ECM scanner and see what is actually going on. The scanner can display the output from each sensor for you.<P>You should also go thru the wiring, especially the ground anchors on the block and bell housing.||||reg||1
